# Jangan kirim berkas ini ke build context (bikin build lambat / bocor rahasia).
# Catatan: kode aplikasi TIDAK di-COPY ke image — ia masuk lewat bind mount di
# docker-compose.yml, supaya edit di editor langsung terlihat tanpa rebuild.
.git
.github
node_modules
vendor
public/build
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
tests/e2e/.playwright
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
database/*.sqlite
*.md
